OL,3,GNEWSAFrom #500 grant to funding        
OL,4,Acharity's new centre                   
OL,6,F"To be in a position where we can fund 
OL,7,Fthis initiative and for them to feel   
OL,8,Fthat that's worthy of naming the site  
OL,9,Fafter me - I still can't really get my 
OL,10,Fhead around it," he said.              
